              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^The show is «о восьмій вечора», at eight in the evening. Don't be late! ",
                "#",
                "^speaker:npc_tower",
                "/#",
                "\n",
                "end",
                {
                  "->": "0.5"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "^Welcome to the Tower, «Вежа»! It's an old water tower with a clock, «годинник», over a hundred years old. ",
          "#",
          "^speaker:npc_tower",
          "/#",
          "\n",
          [
            "ev",
            "str",
            "^Що в цій вежі? (What's in this tower?)",
            "/str",
            "/ev",
            {
              "*": ".^.c-0",
              "flg": 20
            },
            "ev",
            "str",
            "^О котрій сьогодні шоу фонтану? (What time is the fountain show today?)",
            "/str",
            "/ev",
            {
              "*": ".^.c-1",
              "flg": 20
            },
            {
              "c-0": [
                "\n",
                "^It used to store water for the city centre. Now it's a museum, «музей».",
                "\n",
                {
                  "->": ".^.^"
                },
                {
                  "->": "0.g-0"
                },
                {
                  "#f": 5
                }
              ],
              "c-1": [
                "\n",
                "^Today «о восьмій вечора». Repeat it so you don't forget! ",
                "#",
                "^quiz:tower_time_1",
                "/#",
                "\n",
                "ev",
                {
                  "VAR?": "quiz_ok"
                },
                "/ev",
                [
                  {
                    "->": ".^.b",
                    "c": true
                  },
                  {
                    "b": [
                      "\n",
                      "^Right, at eight in the evening!",
                      "\n",
                      "ev",
                      {
                        "VAR?": "trust"
                      },
                      1,
                      "+",
                      {
                        "VAR=": "trust",
                        "re": true
                      },
                      "/ev",
                      {
                        "->": ".^.^.^.11"
                      },
                      null
